            <ArticleTitle>Transmyocardial laser revascularization using a thoracoscopic approach.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>538-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Transmyocardial revascularization is a new technique aimed to improve perfusion of the ischemic myocardium by creating transmyocardial channels with a laser. This report demonstrates that transmyocardial revascularization with a holmium laser can be performed through a thoracoscopic approach.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
